title: "Geophysical-to-Geotechnical Inversion Toolkit"
authors:
  - family-names: "Jariwala"
    given-names: "Shreya"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-17"
url: "https://github.com/ShreyaJari/inversion-toolkit
repository-code: "https://github.com/ShreyaJari/inversion-toolkit
license: MIT
keywords:
  - geoai
  - remote-sensing
  - earth-observation
  - seismic-inversion
  - geotechnical
  - surface-wave-inversion
abstract: >
  A hybrid physics and machine learning pipeline estimating offshore
  geotechnical parameters (cone resistance, sleeve friction) from
  surface-wave inversion of geophysical data, quantifying inversion
  non-uniqueness and validating predictions against a real, held-out
  measured profile.
